SUMMARY:ASCP Annual Meeting 2027
DESCRIPTION:The 2027 ASCP Annual Meeting (formerly NCDEU) is scheduled fo
 r June 1 to 4\, 2027\, in Chicago. Submissions for panels\, posters\, ne
 w investigator awards and pipeline presentations opened in September 202
 6 with deadlines running from November 2026 to March 2027.\n\nDeadlines\
 nPanel and workshop proposals: 2026-11-17\nAward nominations open: 2026-
 11-01\nPoster and individual research report submission: 2027-01-27\nNew
  Investigator Award application: 2027-01-27\nAward nominations close: 20
 27-01-27\nPharmaceutical pipeline presentation submission: 2027-02-18\nL
 ate breaking poster submission opens: 2027-02-24\nLate breaking poster s
 ubmission: 2027-03-12\n\nhttps://ascpp.org/meeting-hub/
LOCATION:Chicago\, Illinois\, Chicago Marriott Downtown Magnificent Mile
URL:https://ascpp.org/meeting-hub/
